{"qid": "76482987", "kind": "freshstack", "language": "python", "title": "Chroma database embeddings = none when using get()", "answer": "The issue is that the embeddings are not being indexed when using the `get` method. This is a known limitation of the current implementation of Chroma. The embeddings are only indexed when using the `query` method.", "valid_output": true, "insufficient_information": false, "retrieved": ["chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_0_8229", "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/getting-started.md_0_6979", "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/reference/cheatsheet.md_0_6165", "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_8230_10165"], "cited_doc_ids": ["chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/getting-started.md_0_6979", "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/reference/cheatsheet.md_0_6165", "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ipynb_8230_10165"], "invalid_citations": [], "repaired_citations": [], "degenerate_answer": false, "context_coverage": 0.0, "context_recall": 0.0, "nuggets": ["Embeddings are excluded by default in the `get()` method for performance reasons.", "Use the `include` parameter with the `get()` method to specify that embeddings should be returned.", "To include embeddings in the `get()` method, use `collection.get(include=['embeddings', 'documents', 'metadatas'])`."], "nuggets_present": null, "nugget_judge_ok": null, "citations": [{"doc_id": "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/getting-started.md_0_6979", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": true}, {"doc_id": "chroma/docs/docs.trychroma.com/pages/reference/cheatsheet.md_0_6165", "supported": null, "judge_supported": null, "quote": null, "quote_found": null, "judge_ok": null, "relevant_in_qrels": false, "judged_in_qrels": true}, {"doc_id": "chroma/examples/basic_functionality/alternative_embeddings.ip